{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もー少しで12月ですよ一年終わりますよはやいなー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、君の足跡を撮って下さった青山さんから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリラジさんの写真集頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/28/4001154/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんと一緒にみたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/28/4001154/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんにこにこ笑顔でみたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもジャンポリで一緒のオリラジさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、ちょっとみてて恥ずかしくなっちゃった(*´꒳`*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青山さんらしい撮り方だなーって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また新たに素敵な作品が出来たのだなって思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の紅白歌合戦出場する事が決まりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも日頃沢山応援して下さっている皆様のお陰です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出場する意味をしっかりメンバー全員が、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂を作る全ての人間が考えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅白の舞台に立ちたいと思います！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅ちゃんも初出場おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"坂道シリーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46の名を与えられた私達。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46無双の幕開け"},{"type":